WEBVTT

00:02.509 --> 00:03.843
KATARA: Water...

00:04.886 --> 00:06.304
Earth...

00:06.804 --> 00:08.139
Fire...

00:09.057 --> 00:10.308
Air.

00:11.142 --> 00:14.646
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.313 --> 00:18.816
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.692 --> 00:22.570
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

00:22.654 --> 00:23.780
could stop them.

00:23.863 --> 00:25.532
But when the world needed him most,

00:25.615 --> 00:26.866
he vanished.

00:27.325 --> 00:28.409
100 years passed,

00:28.493 --> 00:31.204
and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar―

00:31.287 --> 00:32.830
An airbender named Aang.

00:32.914 --> 00:35.124
And although his airbending
skills are great,

00:35.208 --> 00:37.835
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

00:37.919 --> 00:39.087
AANG: Oof.

00:39.170 --> 00:41.839
KATARA: But I believe
Aang can save the world.

01:23.134 --> 01:24.219
Aah!

01:33.228 --> 01:34.729
( AANG BREATHING HEAVILY )

01:39.401 --> 01:40.402
Aang?

01:42.279 --> 01:43.697
Do you want to talk about it?

01:43.780 --> 01:46.616
Nah. Just a nightmare.

01:46.700 --> 01:48.827
I was in the Avatar state,

01:48.910 --> 01:51.079
But I was outside my body,
watching myself.

01:51.955 --> 01:53.456
It was scary.

01:53.540 --> 01:55.000
I was scary.

02:00.588 --> 02:03.341
Katara, I want you to have this.

02:03.425 --> 02:06.344
This amulet contains
water from the spirit oasis.

02:07.053 --> 02:09.097
The water has unique properties.

02:09.180 --> 02:10.515
Don't lose it.

02:11.182 --> 02:12.809
Thank you, Master Pakku.

02:12.892 --> 02:16.354
Aang, these scrolls
will help you master waterbending.

02:16.438 --> 02:20.442
But remember,
they're no substitute for a real master.

02:25.447 --> 02:26.448
Sokka...

02:27.907 --> 02:29.617
Take care, son.

02:31.578 --> 02:34.789
Fly straight to the Earth Kingdom
base to the east of here.

02:34.873 --> 02:38.043
General Fong will provide you
with an escort to Omashu.

02:38.501 --> 02:43.506
There you'll be safe to begin
your earthbending training with King Bumi.

02:43.590 --> 02:46.134
- Appa, yip-yip!
- KATARA: Say hi to Gran-Gran for me.

02:54.601 --> 02:55.769
Ahh.

02:57.228 --> 02:59.814
This is what I've been missing.

02:59.898 --> 03:03.777
Who knew floating
on a piece of driftwood for three weeks

03:03.860 --> 03:05.528
with no food or water

03:06.279 --> 03:09.282
and sea vultures
waiting to pluck out your liver

03:09.366 --> 03:11.701
could make one so tense?

03:13.787 --> 03:18.124
I see. It's the anniversary, isn't it?

03:18.208 --> 03:20.794
Three years ago today, I was banished.

03:20.877 --> 03:23.713
I lost it all. I want it back.

03:24.255 --> 03:28.134
I want the Avatar.
I want my honor, my throne.

03:28.218 --> 03:31.096
I want my father
not to think I'm worthless.

03:31.346 --> 03:36.434
I'm sure he doesn't.
Why would he banish you if he didn't care?

03:38.853 --> 03:41.314
Uh, that came out wrong, didn't it?

04:05.338 --> 04:08.758
My brother and my uncle
have disgraced the Fire Lord,

04:08.842 --> 04:10.468
and brought shame on all of us.

04:11.010 --> 04:14.431
You may have mixed feelings about
attacking members of the royal family.

04:14.514 --> 04:16.891
I understand. But I assure you,

04:16.975 --> 04:21.104
if you hesitate, I will not hesitate
to bring you down.

04:21.604 --> 04:23.106
Dismissed.

04:23.982 --> 04:28.236
Princess, I'm afraid the tides will not
allow us to bring the ship into port

04:28.319 --> 04:29.446
before nightfall.

04:29.529 --> 04:32.740
I'm sorry, captain, but I do not know
much about the tides.

04:33.199 --> 04:34.826
Can you explain something to me?

04:35.410 --> 04:36.870
Of course, your highness.

04:36.953 --> 04:38.872
Do the tides command this ship?

04:39.122 --> 04:41.833
Uh, I'm afraid I don't understand.

04:41.916 --> 04:45.587
You said the tides
would not allow us to bring the ship in.

04:45.670 --> 04:47.839
Do the tides command this ship?

04:48.214 --> 04:49.215
No, princess.

04:49.591 --> 04:51.801
And if I were to have you
thrown overboard,

04:51.885 --> 04:56.431
would the tides think twice about
smashing you against the rocky shore?

04:56.514 --> 04:57.974
No, princess.

04:58.057 --> 05:00.977
Well, then maybe you should
worry less about the tides,

05:01.060 --> 05:03.480
who've already made up
their mind about killing you

05:03.563 --> 05:06.357
and worry more about me,
who's still mulling it over.

05:06.900 --> 05:08.109
I'll pull us in.

05:13.406 --> 05:14.449
There it is!

05:21.706 --> 05:24.250
Welcome, Avatar Aang!

05:24.792 --> 05:27.003
I am General Fong.

05:27.086 --> 05:30.173
And welcome to all of you great heroes―

05:30.256 --> 05:35.053
Appa, Momo, brave Sokka,
the mighty Katara.

05:35.553 --> 05:37.472
Mighty Katara? I like that.

05:37.555 --> 05:38.723
( FIREWORKS )

05:38.806 --> 05:39.849
( MOMO CHATTERING )

05:44.562 --> 05:46.231
Not bad. Not bad.

05:47.899 --> 05:50.568
Avatar Aang, we were all amazed

05:50.652 --> 05:53.154
at the stories of how
you single-handedly wiped out

05:53.238 --> 05:55.406
an entire fire navy fleet
at the North Pole.

05:56.032 --> 05:59.786
I can't imagine what it feels like
to wield such devastating power.

05:59.869 --> 06:01.829
It's an awesome responsibility.

06:01.913 --> 06:03.915
I try not to think about it too much.

06:04.916 --> 06:08.586
Avatar, you're ready
to face the Fire Lord now.

06:08.670 --> 06:10.713
What?! No, I'm not.

06:11.297 --> 06:13.841
Aang still needs to master
all four elements.

06:14.092 --> 06:16.886
Why? With the kind of power he possesses,

06:16.970 --> 06:20.306
Power enough to destroy hundreds
of battleships in a matter of minutes,

06:20.390 --> 06:22.267
He could defeat the Fire Lord now.

06:22.350 --> 06:24.852
But, sir, the thing is,
Aang can only do those things

06:24.936 --> 06:26.729
when he's in the Avatar state.

06:26.813 --> 06:28.690
See, it's this special state where―

06:28.773 --> 06:31.401
I'm well aware.
Your eyes and tattoos glow,

06:31.484 --> 06:34.237
and you're able to summon
unbelievable power.

06:34.946 --> 06:38.116
Without you, we'd be slaughtered
before we even reach their shores.

06:38.199 --> 06:40.868
But with you leading the way,
as the ultimate weapon,

06:41.244 --> 06:44.581
we could cut a swath right through
to the heart of the Fire Nation.

06:44.914 --> 06:49.252
Right, but I don't know how
to get in or out of the Avatar state,

06:49.794 --> 06:51.921
much less what to do once I'm there.

06:52.130 --> 06:53.464
FONG: So it's decided, then.

06:53.548 --> 06:56.301
I'll help you figure out
how to get into the Avatar state,

06:56.384 --> 06:58.011
and then you'll face your destiny.

06:58.094 --> 06:59.971
No. Nothing's decided.

07:00.054 --> 07:01.681
We already have a plan.

07:01.931 --> 07:04.183
Aang's pursuing his destiny his way.

07:04.517 --> 07:07.729
FONG: Well, while you take your time
learning the elements,

07:07.812 --> 07:09.480
the war goes on.

07:10.315 --> 07:11.608
May I show you something?

07:12.900 --> 07:14.569
That's the infirmary.

07:14.652 --> 07:18.823
And those soldiers
are the lucky ones. They came back.

07:19.240 --> 07:21.576
Every day the Fire Nation takes lives.

07:21.659 --> 07:23.453
People are dying, Aang.

07:23.953 --> 07:25.913
You could end it now.

07:26.372 --> 07:27.373
Think about it.

07:46.809 --> 07:48.353
Almost perfect.

07:48.436 --> 07:50.521
One hair out of place.

07:52.231 --> 07:53.941
Almost isn't good enough.

07:59.113 --> 08:00.281
( DISTANT THUNDER )

08:06.537 --> 08:07.747
General Fong?

08:07.830 --> 08:10.500
Come in, Aang.
Have you thought about our discussion?

08:12.669 --> 08:13.961
I'm in.

08:14.045 --> 08:15.296
I'll fight the Fire Lord.

08:27.892 --> 08:29.977
I told the general I'd help him

08:30.478 --> 08:32.397
by going into the Avatar state.

08:32.480 --> 08:34.941
Aang, no. This is not the right way.

08:35.024 --> 08:38.236
Why not? Remember when he took out
the fire navy? He was incredible.

08:38.736 --> 08:40.279
There's a right way to do this―

08:40.363 --> 08:42.198
Practice, study, and discipline.

08:42.281 --> 08:45.076
Or just glow it up
and stop that Fire Lord.

08:45.159 --> 08:48.788
If you two meatheads want to throw away
everything we've worked for, fine.

08:48.871 --> 08:50.289
Go ahead and glow it up.

08:50.498 --> 08:53.292
Katara, I'm just being realistic!

08:53.376 --> 08:55.795
I don't have time
to do this the right way.

09:01.175 --> 09:04.595
This rare chi-enhancing tea
is a natural stimulant.

09:05.221 --> 09:09.517
In an ordinary warrior,
it improves strength and energy tenfold.

09:09.934 --> 09:13.438
In you, it may induce the Avatar state.

09:13.730 --> 09:15.314
Tenfold energy, huh?

09:18.609 --> 09:20.027
Is it working? Is it working?

09:20.111 --> 09:22.780
I can't tell! Somebody tell me
if I'm in the Avatar state

09:22.864 --> 09:25.742
'Cause I don't have a good view
of myself. Am I talking loud?

09:25.825 --> 09:27.952
I guess he could talk
the Fire Lord to death.

09:28.536 --> 09:29.704
Uh!

09:31.831 --> 09:34.083
Maybe I can shock you
into the Avatar state.

09:34.542 --> 09:35.585
I love surprises.

09:37.712 --> 09:39.589
-( SCREECHES )
- Aah!

09:41.632 --> 09:42.842
Still not glowing.

09:43.050 --> 09:45.636
Uh! Uh! Aah!

09:49.849 --> 09:52.977
You are wearing a ceremonial
piece of clothing

09:53.060 --> 09:55.897
from each of the bending nations.

09:55.980 --> 09:59.609
Now, I will join
the four elements into one.

09:59.692 --> 10:05.531
Water, earth, fire, air!

10:05.615 --> 10:08.618
Four elements together as one.

10:10.244 --> 10:11.579
This is just mud.

10:11.662 --> 10:13.873
So, do you feel anything?

10:17.543 --> 10:19.128
( SNEEZES )

10:20.171 --> 10:21.756
We have to find a way.

10:25.218 --> 10:28.554
Look at these magnificent shells.

10:28.638 --> 10:32.225
I'll enjoy these keepsakes
for years to come.

10:32.308 --> 10:34.185
We don't need any more useless things.

10:34.560 --> 10:37.104
You forget,
we have to carry everything ourselves now.

10:37.188 --> 10:40.441
Hello, brother, uncle.

10:40.525 --> 10:42.276
What are you doing here?

10:42.360 --> 10:46.531
In my country, we exchange
a pleasant hello before asking questions.

10:46.906 --> 10:49.826
Have you become uncivilized
so soon, Zu Zu?

10:49.909 --> 10:51.244
Don't call me that.

10:51.702 --> 10:54.288
To what do we owe this honor?

10:54.372 --> 10:56.582
Hmm, must be a family trait.

10:56.666 --> 10:58.626
Both of you so quick to get to the point.

10:59.752 --> 11:01.712
I've come with a message from home.

11:01.796 --> 11:06.217
Father's changed his mind. Family is
suddenly very important to him.

11:06.300 --> 11:08.928
He's heard rumors
of plans to overthrow him―

11:09.011 --> 11:10.763
Treacherous plots.

11:11.180 --> 11:14.600
Family are the only ones
you can really trust.

11:15.852 --> 11:19.355
Father regrets your banishment.
He wants you home.

11:21.732 --> 11:26.237
Did you hear me? You should be happy,
excited, grateful.

11:26.320 --> 11:28.447
I just gave you great news.

11:28.531 --> 11:31.117
I'm sure your brother
simply needs a moment―

11:31.200 --> 11:32.326
Don't interrupt, uncle.

11:33.077 --> 11:34.829
I still haven't heard my thank you.

11:34.912 --> 11:37.748
I'm not a messenger.
I didn't have to come all this way.

11:38.249 --> 11:42.545
Father regrets? He wants me back?

11:42.753 --> 11:45.214
I can see you need time to take this in.

11:45.298 --> 11:48.175
I'll come to call on you tomorrow.
Good evening.

11:51.846 --> 11:54.223
KATARA: Can we talk about something?
AANG: Sure.

11:54.765 --> 11:56.934
Do you remember
when we were at the air temple

11:57.018 --> 11:58.895
and you found Monk Gyatso's skeleton?

11:59.312 --> 12:02.023
It must have been so horrible
and traumatic for you.

12:02.982 --> 12:05.943
I saw you get so upset
that you weren't even you anymore.

12:06.027 --> 12:11.115
I'm not saying the Avatar state
doesn't have incredible and helpful power.

12:11.198 --> 12:14.869
But you have to understand,
for the people who love you,

12:14.952 --> 12:18.122
watching you be in that much
rage and pain is really scary.

12:19.916 --> 12:21.918
I'm really glad you told me that,

12:22.710 --> 12:24.462
But I still need to do this.

12:24.545 --> 12:26.005
I don't understand.

12:26.088 --> 12:27.465
No, you don't.

12:27.882 --> 12:29.967
Every day, more and more people die.

12:30.051 --> 12:32.094
I'm already a hundred years late.

12:32.178 --> 12:35.056
Defeating the Fire Lord
is the only way to stop this war.

12:35.139 --> 12:36.891
I have to try it.

12:37.141 --> 12:39.435
I can't watch you do this to yourself.

12:39.518 --> 12:41.312
I'm not coming tomorrow.

12:42.229 --> 12:43.230
Good night.

12:43.314 --> 12:44.315
Good night.

12:46.651 --> 12:47.652
We're going home

12:48.110 --> 12:49.528
after three long years.

12:49.612 --> 12:50.905
It's unbelievable.

12:51.364 --> 12:53.658
It is unbelievable.

12:53.741 --> 12:56.744
I have never known my brother
to regret anything.

12:57.411 --> 12:59.038
Did you listen to Azula?

12:59.121 --> 13:01.499
Father's realized how important
family is to him.

13:01.582 --> 13:02.750
He cares about me.

13:03.250 --> 13:04.710
I care about you.

13:04.794 --> 13:07.838
I mean, if Ozai wants you back, well,

13:07.922 --> 13:11.008
I think it may not be
for the reasons you imagine.

13:11.092 --> 13:13.177
You don't know
how my father feels about me.

13:13.260 --> 13:14.512
You don't know anything.

13:14.595 --> 13:17.974
Zuko, I only meant that in our family,

13:18.349 --> 13:20.601
things are not always what they seem.

13:21.102 --> 13:23.396
I think you are exactly what you seem―

13:23.479 --> 13:26.482
A lazy, mistrustful, shallow old man

13:26.565 --> 13:28.901
who's always been jealous of his brother.

13:42.081 --> 13:43.290
Aah!

13:49.922 --> 13:52.049
Sokka, Sokka, wake up.

13:52.133 --> 13:53.342
Huh?

13:53.426 --> 13:56.387
I don't think we should be trying
to bring on the Avatar state.

13:56.846 --> 13:58.681
- You sure?
- Yes.

13:58.889 --> 14:00.016
Ok.

14:00.099 --> 14:01.976
Do you think the general will be mad?

14:02.309 --> 14:04.520
What can he say? You're the Avatar.

14:04.603 --> 14:05.855
Who knows better than you?

14:13.654 --> 14:14.739
Wait!

14:14.822 --> 14:16.824
Don't leave without me.

14:17.450 --> 14:20.119
Uncle, you've changed your mind.

14:20.202 --> 14:22.371
Family sticks together, right?

14:27.376 --> 14:28.836
We're finally going home.

14:34.925 --> 14:39.346
AANG: The thing is, I don't think we'll
ever be able to trigger it on purpose.

14:39.847 --> 14:41.182
So I guess that's it.

14:41.682 --> 14:43.434
Sure I can't change your mind?

14:43.768 --> 14:47.855
I'm sure. I can only reach the Avatar
state when I'm in genuine danger.

14:48.355 --> 14:51.817
I see. I was afraid you'd say that.

14:55.571 --> 14:56.614
Aang!

14:57.364 --> 14:58.866
( AANG YELLS )

15:03.954 --> 15:07.583
Men, attack the Avatar.

15:22.765 --> 15:24.141
What are you doing?

15:24.391 --> 15:26.268
I believe we are about to get results.

15:34.193 --> 15:37.696
I'm not your enemy. I won't fight you.

16:13.941 --> 16:15.693
You can't run forever!

16:16.110 --> 16:17.528
You can't fight forever.

16:35.629 --> 16:37.464
Brother, uncle,

16:37.882 --> 16:39.175
welcome.

16:40.384 --> 16:42.845
I'm so glad you decided to come.

16:43.637 --> 16:46.140
Are we ready to depart, your highness?

16:46.348 --> 16:48.684
Set our course for home, captain.

16:49.101 --> 16:50.352
Home.

16:50.769 --> 16:53.230
You heard the princess. Raise the anchors.

16:53.314 --> 16:55.107
We're taking the prisoners home.

16:57.735 --> 16:59.278
Your highness, I...

17:07.703 --> 17:08.787
You lied to me.

17:09.163 --> 17:10.831
Like I've never done that before.

17:13.459 --> 17:14.460
( YELLS )

17:14.543 --> 17:15.544
Aah!

17:18.339 --> 17:20.549
I wonder what crazy thing
they're trying now.

17:21.300 --> 17:22.927
( PURRS )

17:23.010 --> 17:24.345
( HEAVY THUDS )

17:24.428 --> 17:26.388
Maybe we should just make sure Aang's ok.

17:29.683 --> 17:30.935
What's going on?

17:31.018 --> 17:32.436
The general's gone crazy.

17:32.811 --> 17:35.522
He's trying to force Aang
into the Avatar state.

17:43.530 --> 17:45.866
Good bird-horse thingy.

17:53.332 --> 17:56.543
Maybe you can avoid me, but she can't.

18:08.597 --> 18:09.723
I can't move.

18:10.307 --> 18:11.558
Don't hurt her.

18:17.815 --> 18:19.149
Katara, no!

18:21.026 --> 18:23.195
Whoa!

18:24.780 --> 18:27.199
Stop this! You have to let her go.

18:27.283 --> 18:29.743
You could save her
if you were in the Avatar state.

18:30.160 --> 18:32.454
I'm trying. I'm trying.

18:32.913 --> 18:34.415
Aang, I'm sinking!

18:34.873 --> 18:36.542
I don't see glowing.

18:38.377 --> 18:40.170
Aah! Please.

18:40.629 --> 18:42.423
You don't need to do this.

18:42.506 --> 18:44.842
Apparently, I do.

18:46.302 --> 18:47.303
Aah!

18:51.974 --> 18:53.100
It worked.

18:53.183 --> 18:54.852
It worked!

19:00.566 --> 19:01.775
Aah!

19:15.456 --> 19:17.166
Zuko, let's go!

19:19.793 --> 19:21.337
Hyah! Hyah! Hyah...

19:25.466 --> 19:28.635
You know, father blames uncle
for the loss at the North Pole.

19:28.719 --> 19:32.514
And he considers you a miserable failure
for not finding the Avatar.

19:33.015 --> 19:34.558
Why would he want you back home,

19:34.641 --> 19:37.561
except to lock you up
where you can no longer embarrass him?

19:38.812 --> 19:40.105
( YELLING )

20:09.802 --> 20:11.220
Aah! Uh!

20:17.226 --> 20:20.771
Avatar Aang, can you hear me?

20:21.522 --> 20:23.399
Your friend is safe.

20:23.482 --> 20:26.026
It was just a trick
to trigger the Avatar state.

20:26.735 --> 20:28.278
And it worked!

20:50.676 --> 20:52.719
It's time you learned.

20:58.016 --> 21:01.061
The Avatar state is a defense mechanism

21:01.145 --> 21:06.984
designed to empower you with the skills
and knowledge of all the past Avatars.

21:07.067 --> 21:11.029
The glow is the combination
of all your past lives

21:11.780 --> 21:15.200
focusing their energy through your body.

21:18.620 --> 21:20.456
In the Avatar state,

21:20.789 --> 21:22.749
you are at your most powerful...

21:24.960 --> 21:28.130
But you're also at your most vulnerable.

21:28.213 --> 21:29.256
What do you mean?

21:29.339 --> 21:31.508
If you are killed in the Avatar state,

21:32.426 --> 21:35.721
The reincarnation cycle will be broken

21:35.804 --> 21:39.141
and the Avatar will cease to exist.

21:56.617 --> 22:01.038
I'm sorry, Katara. I hope you never
have to see me like that again.

22:01.121 --> 22:04.166
Ha! Are you joking?
That was almost perfect.

22:04.249 --> 22:07.461
We just have to find out a way
to control you when you're like that.

22:07.544 --> 22:08.962
You're out of your mind.

22:09.046 --> 22:11.840
I guess we'll figure it out
on the way to the Fire Nation.

22:13.258 --> 22:14.801
Anybody got a problem with that?

22:16.386 --> 22:19.306
Do you still want an escort to Omashu?

22:20.557 --> 22:21.850
I think we're all set.

22:27.022 --> 22:28.899
Anyone who harbors these traitors

22:28.982 --> 22:30.943
will face the wrath of the Fire Lord.

22:32.361 --> 22:34.696
There will be no place left to hide.

22:41.161 --> 22:42.829
I think we're safe here.
